  "description": {
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (en): Panicum hirticaule",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Panicum_hirticaule",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1297847304,
      "text": "Panicum hirticaule is a species of grass known by the common names Mexican panicgrass and roughstalked witchgrass. It is also known as the Sonoran millet, and is cultivated as a cereal crop in the American Southwest."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Panicum hirticaule",
      "source_url": "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Panicum_hirticaule",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 220273290,
      "text": "Panicum hirticaule est une espèce de plantes monocotylédones de la famille des Poaceae, sous-famille des Panicoideae, originaire du continent américain.\nCe sont des plantes herbacées annuelles, cespiteuses, aux tiges (chaumes) dressées ou géniculées ascendantes et aux inflorescences en panicules."
    },
    "id": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (id): Panicum hirticaule",
      "source_url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Panicum_hirticaule",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 26158497,
      "text": "Panicum hirticaule adalah spesies tumbuhan yang tergolong ke dalam famili Poaceae. Spesies ini juga merupakan bagian dari ordo Poales. Spesies Panicum hirticaule sendiri merupakan bagian dari genus Panicum. Nama ilmiah dari spesies ini pertama kali diterbitkan oleh J.Presl."
    }
  },
